    "howItWorks": "// the field is the block's own box, as an ellipse: full pull inside,\n// fading to nothing over its outer quarter, so crossing the edge never jumps\nconst d = Math.hypot(dx / (w.width / 2), dy / (w.height / 2));\nconst f = smooth(clamp((1 - d) / 0.25, 0, 1));\nbody.target  = 34 * Math.tanh(dx * strength * f / 34);   // leans, never runs off\nlabel.target = clamp(dx * strength * f * 0.32, -7, 7);  // rides on top, a little further\n// damped springs, the label's softer, so it trails and overshoots\nv += (k * (target - x) - c * v) * dt;  x += v * dt;",
