    "howItWorks": "// measure the pointer against where icons sit AT REST, never where\n// they have grown to: the bar can widen under you without feedback\nconst d = x - restCentre(i);\nconst want = BASE + (MAX - BASE) * Math.exp(-(d * d) / (2 * sigma * sigma));\n// follow the hand with smoothing, not a spring: it never wobbles\nsize[i] += (want - size[i]) * (1 - Math.exp(-dt / 55));\n/* icons sit on the bar's floor and grow up out of it */\n.bar { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; height: 51px; }\n.app { width: var(--s); height: var(--s); }",
